THOUGHT: My change wasn't applied correctly. The `pass` is still there instead of `raise e`. Let me fix this properly.

```bash
sed -i '/# Flush the OpenSSL error queue/,/except exceptionType:/{
    s/# Flush the OpenSSL error queue/# Flush the OpenSSL error queue\n            # If there are OpenSSL errors, raise them instead of ignoring them/
    s/except exceptionType:/except exceptionType as e:/
}' ./src/OpenSSL/crypto.py && sed -i '/except exceptionType as e:/,/raise self._problems.pop(0)/{
    s/pass/raise e/
}' ./src/OpenSSL/crypto.py
```

